 the hiding place of a witness he kidnapped. He resorts to a hypnosis thera
 pist (Amina Khalil) to retrieve this missing information. But\, in order t
 o restore his memory\, he needs to confront old enemies\, past events\, an
 d most importantly... himself.\n\nhttps://cinesembajadores.es/pelicula/had
 oota-vosi/?ciudad=madrid
LOCATION:Cine Embajadores Río - Calle Ercilla\, 53
